## Change under review

The tool could only review benchmark cases. This adds a review subcommand that assembles the same Case value in memory from a repository path and a diff file, runs the existing pipeline, and renders a report for a human. A new review module holds the request type, the case construction and the renderer; main.rs gains the subcommand and lib.rs exports the module.

