    diff.patch and repository/; a real review is the same Case value assembled in
    memory from a repository path and a diff. Nothing else changes -- same prompts,
    same sandbox, same evidence gate, same four roles. If this path produced better
    results than the benchmark harness, the benchmark would be measuring the wrong
    thing.

